  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Ensure IO Graph Legend appears if box checked",
  "description": "Since there is now a preference and checkbox for enabling and\ndisabling the IO Graph legend, display it even if there is only\none plot (or all the plots would have the same Y-axis) so long\nas the box is checked.\n\nPreviously the logic was to display the legend if and only if plots\nhad differing Y-axis information, but now the user can use the checkbox\ninstead of relying on that heuristic.\n\nAlso, ensure that we replot the legend layer when updating the\nlegend (so that it appears or disappears without having to, e.g.,\nmouse over the graph.)\n\nFollow up to bcc9e0db0c7724c401955229ed83f62a736bb041\n\nFix #13854",
  "state": "merged",
